# AI Email Automation System with Review Step

## 🎥 Demo
[https://youtu.be/THOq8kAwT_0]

## ❓ Problem
Responding to emails manually takes time and effort.

## 💡 Solution
Built an AI system that generates reply drafts automatically with a human review step.

## ⚙️ Workflow
1. Receive email
2. Trigger automation
3. Generate reply using AI
4. Save as draft
5. Review manually
6. Send email

## 🛠️ Tools Used
- Make.com
- AI (OpenAI)

## 📊 Use Cases
- Customer support
- Business communication
- Email management

## 🚀 Key Learning
Human-in-the-loop automation creates safer and more reliable systems.
